  "title": "Blind Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF) In The downloadPublicImportFile Endpoint",
  "summary": "The import download endpoint accepts a user-controlled fileUrl and performs an outbound HTTP request from the Rocket.Chat server using Node’s native http.get / https.get APIs. The native HTTP does not perform checks against SSRF attacks similarly to Rocket.Chat's serverFetch package.",
